msgid "None declared: the command table (``CommandRow`` in ``menu-table.ts``) declares no slots, types or defaults. Keyword slots passed to ``em.app.commands.run`` reach the page but are dropped by the host hook (``frontend/src/main.ts:65807``), which calls ``runCommand(id)`` only."
msgstr ""

msgid "From Python"
msgstr ""

msgid "The page presses the command's button, as a click would: whatever dialog the command opens, opens. If the button is disabled at that moment (or the id is unknown) the call raises ``em.NotAvailable`` (``py.noCommand``). Outside EMStudio (no host) the call raises ``em.NotAvailable``."
